{"id":"17f36b05a2fd2754","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power.md","title":"Divisibility and Powers of a Prime with Zero Boundaries","display":"df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power — Divisibility and Powers of a Prime with Zero Boundaries","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power"],"display":"df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power — Divisibility and Powers of a Prime with Zero Boundaries","source":"第 IV 章 p. 43，Lemma 1（PDF 60）","source_status":"原书机制的重构，并显式补零值条件","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power — Divisibility and Powers of a Prime with Zero Boundaries"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 p. 43，Lemma 1（PDF 60）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书机制的重构，并显式补零值条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a375244351119bb\" href=\"?note=9a375244351119bb\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes\">92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\geq2\">\\(p\\geq2\\)</span> 为外部素数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,u\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,u\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下是外部关系的有界算术展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 和乘法是原书无指数原语；关系类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a375244351119bb\" href=\"?note=9a375244351119bb\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes\">92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}divisibility\\text{-}prime\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Div}(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\leq y\\;(x\\cdot u=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(x)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x&gt;0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq x\\;[(\\operatorname{Div}(u,x)\\land u\\ne1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(p,u)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(y)\\land y&gt;x\\land y&gt;1\\land\n\\forall u&lt;y\\;\\neg(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(u)\\land u&gt;x\\land u&gt;1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}divisibility\\text{-}prime\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Div}(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\leq y\\;(x\\cdot u=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(x)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x&gt;0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq x\\;[(\\operatorname{Div}(u,x)\\land u\\ne1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(p,u)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(y)\\land y&gt;x\\land y&gt;1\\land\n\\forall u&lt;y\\;\\neg(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(u)\\land u&gt;x\\land u&gt;1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Div}(0,0)\">\\(\\operatorname{Div}(0,0)\\)</span> 按通常“存在乘数”的关系定义为真，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Div}(0,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Div}(0,y)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&gt;0\">\\(y&gt;0\\)</span> 时为假。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Pow}_p\\)</span> 显式排除 0，并包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^0=1\">\\(p^0=1\\)</span>。若正整数不是 p 的幂，它有一个异于 p 的素因子；反之 p 的正因子除 1 外均含 p，因此幂的刻画成立。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)\\)</span> 唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=p^{\\ell_p(x)}\">\\(y=p^{\\ell_p(x)}\\)</span>；要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&gt;1\">\\(y&gt;1\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=0\">\\(x=0\\)</span> 时输出 p，而不是 1。这些都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}\">\\(\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}\\)</span> 关系。原书 Pow 的有界显示式未写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;0\">\\(x&gt;0\\)</span>；若直接对 x=0 使用，所有有界因子都被截成 0，式子会错误接受 0，此处补上必要边界条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","status":"resolved","id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","status":"resolved","id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下是外部关系的有界算术展开，$\\leq$ 和乘法是原书无指数原语；关系类见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,u\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}divisibility\\text{-}prime\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Div}(x,y)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\leq y\\;(x\\cdot u=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(x)&\\leftrightarrow x>0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq x\\;[(\\operatorname{Div}(u,x)\\land u\\ne1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(p,u)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pow}_p(y)\\land y>x\\land y>1\\land\n\\forall u<y\\;\\neg(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(u)\\land u>x\\land u>1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Div}(0,0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Div}(0,y)","display":false},{"tex":"y>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow}_p","display":false},{"tex":"p^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Scale}_p(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"y=p^{\\ell_p(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"y>1","display":false},{"tex":"x=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}","display":false},{"tex":"x>0","display":false}],"bytes":1926,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"73270f29098db683","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]]"}],"outgoing":["9a375244351119bb"]}